# Context hygiene, not a per-image filter: one context serves this
# Dockerfile and the compose overrides. A pattern here that excludes
# something the image COPYs makes the build fail with "not found" pointing
# at the Dockerfile rather than at this file.
#
# So only ballast is listed: build output, caches, VCS metadata and the
# local machine state that must never reach an image.
#
# The `zio/` submodule IS part of the context — the image builds the Zio
# CLI from it — so it is not excluded. Its own `.git` is.
target
**/target
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/node_modules
**/.git
**/.DS_Store
